  "note": "The MemoryOS 1.3.1 retained-regression suites, run by path. repositories/cca-studio/package.json is pinned in released closures and is not edited; its own `npm test` is the studio-existing suite. Each suite is its own process and its own log; a rerun is its own row in the retained regression record (Freeze SH23). `nodeArgs` suites run under the pinned Node (the runner's own executable); `expect` is a strict count the validator enforces. `expectedFailing` pins the counts of a suite that fails identically at the v1.3.0 baseline; the validator accepts exactly those counts (and nothing else) for it.",
  "suites": [
    {
